{"id":"719296019c11ec36","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness.md","title":"PA 上可递归真理理论的两种不完备性","display":"cor-truth-theory-incompleteness — PA 上可递归真理理论的两种不完备性","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness","aliases":["91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness","91-cor-truth-incomplete","91-cor-Godel-truth"],"display":"cor-truth-theory-incompleteness — PA 上可递归真理理论的两种不完备性","depends_on":["[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness</span><span>91-cor-truth-incomplete</span><span>91-cor-Godel-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-theory-incompleteness — PA 上可递归真理理论的两种不完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为可递归公理化、对标准算术可靠的经典真理理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_S\\)</span> 用通常可证性谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> 编码。</li>\n<li>所选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> 满足通常 Hilbert–Bernays–Löb 条件：定理可证性、可证蕴涵分配、可证性的正内省。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 为基础句子类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ [\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi],\n\\qquad S\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ [\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi],\n\\qquad S\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选通常 Gödel 句 G：若 S 证明 G，则通常可证性给矛盾；若标准模型中 G 假，标准证明代码又使 S 证明 G，从而仍矛盾。因此 G 真，算术可靠性排除 S 证明 ¬G。第二结论用 Löb 定理及所列自然可证性条件。\n旧稿仅写 S 包含 Q 就直接调用第二不完备定理而不列编码条件，现限定为本书 PA 扩张及通常证明谓词，不作最弱算术版本的额外主张。FS 算术可靠性虽成立，ω 不一致性与这里的算术不完备性并不矛盾。\n这一结论不适用于以全部真算术作公理的不可递归理论，也不自动给相应 T 原子的不可证性，后者还需 T-out。</p>\n<p>来源：§8.6 的 Gödel/Löb 与证明编码讨论；通常第一、第二不完备定理的本目录展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\ [\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\varphi\\land S\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi],\n\\qquad S\\nvdash\\operatorname{Con}_S.","display":true}],"bytes":1946,"backlinks":[{"id":"e55a4d03b99a537e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e9c2daf67c9f2e7b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["41fdad0bfaff0bf5","4e50c115b0d32044"]}